==> README.md <==
# Acme Notes

Acme Notes is an Expo (SDK 57) and React Native app. Its foundation (routing, session, HTTP, storage, theming, error reporting, i18n, test setup) came from a starter; every third-party service sits behind a typed seam with a no-op or console default.

